  "artifact_profile": "l1_standard",
  "description": "Verifies raw.emulation.deviceMetrics by issuing raw CDP command(s) Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride, Runtime.enable, Runtime.evaluate against an about:blank page. It passes when every non-optional CDP step completes without a protocol error. Optional steps are best-effort, and returned values are not graded.",
